      "source": {
        "kind": "shine"
      },
      "question": "Read the extract and answer the questions.\n\n*He stalks in his vivid stripes*\n*The few steps of his cage,*\n*On pads of velvet quiet,*\n*In his quiet rage.*\n\n(i) Who is 'he'?\n\n(ii) What does 'stalks' mean here?\n\n(iii) What are 'pads of velvet'?\n\n(iv) Name the device in 'quiet rage'.\n\n(v) Find the rhyming words.",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "answer_steps": [
        "(i) The tiger in the zoo.",
        "(ii) Walks stiffly, angrily, to and fro.",
        "(iii) The soft paws of the tiger.",
        "(iv) Oxymoron.",
        "(v) cage/rage."
      ],
      "marking_scheme": [
        "(i) 1 mark",
        "(ii) 1 mark",
        "(iii) 1 mark",
        "(iv) 1 mark",
        "(v) 1 mark"
      ]
    },
