      },
      "question": "Read the extract and answer the questions.\n\n*He should be lurking in shadow,*\n*Sliding through long grass*\n*Near the water hole*\n*Where plump deer pass.*\n\n(i) Where should the tiger be?\n\n(ii) Why would he wait near the water hole?\n\n(iii) Find a word meaning 'waiting in hiding'.\n\n(iv) Find an example of alliteration.\n\n(v) What mood does this stanza show?",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "answer_steps": [
        "(i) In the forest, near the water hole.",
        "(ii) To hunt the deer that come to drink.",
        "(iii) Lurking.",
        "(iv) 'Sliding... long grass' / 'should... shadow'.",
        "(v) The freedom and power of the wild."
      ],
      "marking_scheme": [
